  "description": "dotnet new templates for generating PDFs from HTML in .NET with SelectPdf (Chromium): an ASP.NET Core API that renders a Razor invoice to PDF, with a Dockerfile that runs on Linux x64/ARM64, and a console app that converts a URL or HTML file to PDF. Uses the free SelectPdf Community Edition by default (up to 5 pages per document), or the licensed SelectPdf.Universal with --edition full.",
